            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Allergic rhinitis is a highly prevalent and costly condition. The disease burden suffered by patients includes the morbidity of the nasal symptoms, the impairment of multiple domains of quality of life, and numerous comorbidities. The goal of therapy is long-term good control.</AbstractText>
